OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after motorcyclist dies in
OL,4,Avillage crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmotorcyclist died following a crash in
OL,8,Fa village.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said the
OL,11,Fcollision, involving a motorcycle and a
OL,12,Fblack Ford Mustang Mach-E, happened in
OL,13,FElton Road, Wansford, at about 19:15
OL,14,FGMT on Wednesday.
OL,16,FEmergency services, including the air
OL,17,Fambulance, attended, but the
OL,18,Fmotorcyclist died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
