OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after motorcyclist dies in
OL,4,Avillage crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the car, a 27-year-old
OL,7,Fman from Peterborough, was taken to
OL,8,Fhospital with minor injuries. Police
OL,9,Fsay he has since been arrested on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving and remains in police custody.
